{
 "header": {
  "probe": "Q27",
  "question": "Q27: what does SetTestSignalFrequency take? The vendor says Hertz [vendor: PDF p.28], and Get reads the Hz Commander shows, but on 2026-10-23 Commander kept 2 Hz for every value ommm sent (50, 100, 200 Hz; check_amplifier). Seal Test Frequency (V-Clamp) and then Tuning Frequency (I-Clamp) are set through the raw API to values that tell Hertz from a period in seconds, millihertz or a list position apart, each read back, with a screenshot of the V-Clamp tab after each; then put back.",
  "time": "2026-10-23T13:28:07.010879-04:00",
  "setup": "amplifier on, a model cell on the headstage, its switch at CELL (--model-cell CELL)",
